        "kind": "events",
        "text": "Plan you next event with us! Our venue event options include semi-private dining room seating up to 24 guests, private dining room seating 40-46 guests, and full venue use accommodating up to 75 guests with the option to clear tables for appetizers, mingling, or dancing. Click link here to inquire about events for 15 guests or more. For less than 15 guests, you can make a standard reservation by calling our restaurant directly at 469-664-0100 or emailing us at info@theheritagetable.com . Check out our Event Information Sheet and Pricing here And view a short wedding video here , showing the full venue use! BOOK YOUR EVENT HERE Dinner Menu Dietary Accommodation Dinner Menu Drinks Menu Wine Menu"
