        "kind": "story",
        "text": "A culture is built on the food it consumes. Cuisine is a reflection of innovation, necessity, and creativity: it is a form of expression wholly unique to any given culture\u2019s history. Our responsibility is to find the best of what our local farmers, ranchers and artisans have to offer and combine it with the inherent sense of hospitality to our neighborhood to create an exceptional dining experience."
