        "heading": "Chef Rich Vana",
        "images": [
          "https://www.theheritagetable.com/dev/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Untitled-design-33.png"
        ],
        "kind": "feature",
        "text": "Rich Vana is the Chef and Owner of The Heritage Table, which opened in 2013. With a focus on presenting his guests with innovative, yet accessible fare, he dedicates a strong focus to sourcing from local farms and ranches. Having spent time in many kitchens with chefs across Dallas while working as a culinary writer, Rich gained tremendous insight from those who drive the area\u2019s culinary culture. Rich continued this passion he found, and strives daily to build on the culture in Frisco and North Texas."
